          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொன்விழா — poṉviḻā — \"a golden jubilee\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடையின் பொன்விழாவைப் பெரிதாகக் கொண்டாடினார்கள். kaṭaiyiṉ poṉviḻāvaip peritākak koṇṭāṭiṉārkaḷ. They celebrated the shop's golden jubilee in a big way."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொன், gold: fifty years; வெள்ளிவிழா, silver, is twenty-five."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பொன்விழா (poṉviḻā) is a Tamil compound built from பொன், \"gold\" (DEDR 4570), and விழா, \"festival\" (DEDR 5427)."
            }
